<title>USA: Cooper Industries acquires Coiltronics.</title>
<headline>Cooper Industries acquires Coiltronics.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cooper Industries Inc said Friday it acquired Coiltronics Inc for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Coiltronics, headquartered in Boca Raton, Fla., manufactures inductors and transformers used in electronic filtering applications. The company's revenues are about $18 million a year.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
